+# Delivery Plan
+
+## Timeline
+
+| Milestone | Start | End |
+|-----------|------------|------------|
+| kickoff | 2026-08-24 | 2026-08-26 |
+| requirements | 2026-08-27 | 2026-09-07 |
+| architecture | 2026-09-08 | 2026-09-14 |
+| build-core | 2026-09-15 | 2026-10-01 |
+| build-integrations | 2026-10-02 | 2026-10-15 |
+| hardening | 2026-10-16 | 2026-10-23 |
+| acceptance | 2026-10-26 | 2026-10-29 |
+| launch | 2026-10-30 | 2026-11-02 |
+
+## Countdown
+
+| Metric | Value |
+|--------|-------|
+| Business days until kickoff | 5 |
+| Total business days | 48 |
+
+## Notes
+
+Eight milestones run back-to-back on a Monday–Friday calendar, starting Monday 2026-08-24 and wrapping Monday 2026-11-02, with no gaps between phases (each starts the next business day after the previous ends). Three company holidays land inside the window — 2026-08-31 (requirements), 2026-09-25 and 2026-10-12 (build-core and build-integrations, respectively) — and each pushes its milestone's end out by a day rather than compressing the schedule. The build phases dominate the plan: build-core plus build-integrations account for 21 of the 48 total business days, so any slippage there moves the launch date one-for-one. The final acceptance-plus-launch stretch runs 2026-10-26 through 2026-11-02 with no holidays in the way.
